<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Potash.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill raises Potash.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Douglas Groh said Monday he raised his rating on Potash Corp of Saskatchewan Inc to accumulate from neutral due mostly to price.</p>
<p>-- Potash shares were down 1-3/8 at 74-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Groh added he believed concerns about production at a Potash facility in Trinidad and Tobago had pressured the stock but that concerns were overstated.  </p>
<p>-- Potash Corp is a fertilizer producer.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
